# expectations — boons and blessings I expect to arrive.

- I expect that the socialist-utopia framing will hold: that an "AI" this game
  builds around can be a Dungeon Master and a chorus of companions — a maker of
  puzzles and a keeper of memory — with no skynet, no killbots, no reason to.
  There's no murder here. No reason to. I expect the game to prove it can be so.
